  "description": "Fourstroke 01 is an XCO performance bike that exceeds the demands of the world’s top racers. On a mission to set the pace with our unique Autodrop technology and unrivalled APS dual-link suspension with 100mm of front and rear travel, it bests the competition in a Premium Carbon frame. This revolutionized racing machine arrives with integrated protection and is designed around the progressive BMC geometry, now accommodating two water bottles in the front triangle for long-distance missions. Fourstroke 01 TWO is a medal winning machine with the innovative SRAM GX Eagle Transmission drivetrain, RockShox SID SL Select+ fork and RockShox SIDLuxe Select+ shock, XCD-30W carbon wheels and the BMC Autodrop integrated dropper seatpost.",
